## 📝 Learning Log
### 2024-01-20 - Cart Drawer Animation
**Tried**: CSS transitions
**Result**: Janky on mobile
**Learning**: Use transform3d for hardware acceleration
**Applied**: Switched to transform3d, smooth now

## ✅ Completed
